# =====================================================================
# BMW KAB AAYEGI? — GITIGNORE
# =====================================================================
# File     : .gitignore
# Version  : 3.0.0
# Updated  : 2026-01-15
#
# PURPOSE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prevent committing:
#   • Sensitive files (secrets, credentials, certificates)
#   • Dependencies (node_modules)
#   • Build artifacts (dist, build)
#   • Logs, caches, temp files
#   • OS/IDE junk files
#
# CONNECTED FILES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ✅ COMMIT:    .env.example, package.json, package-lock.json,
#               source code, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, manifest.json
# ❌ IGNORE:    .env, node_modules/, *.log, .DS_Store, dist/, build/
# =====================================================================


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 01. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES & SECRETS (CRITICAL)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit files containing passwords, API keys, or secrets.
# Only .env.example is safe (contains placeholders, no real values).

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 01B. CERTIFICATES & PRIVATE KEYS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# SSL certs, private keys, keystores — NEVER commit.

*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 01C. CREDENTIAL FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Service account keys, OAuth secrets, etc.

secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account.json
config.local.json
.google-credentials.json
.aws/credentials


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 02. DEPENDENCIES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Installed via `npm install` — no need to commit.
# EXCEPTION: package-lock.json MUST be committed (reproducibility).

node_modules/
jspm_packages/
bower_components/
.pnp/
.pnp.js
.yarn/cache/
.yarn/unplugged/
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/install-state.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 03. BUILD OUTPUTS & ARTIFACTS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated by build tools — reproducible from source.

dist/
build/
out/
.output/
.next/
.nuxt/
.svelte-kit/
.vercel/output/
.netlify/
public/build/
public/dist/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 04. CACHE FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tool-specific caches — safe to regenerate.

.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.prettier-cache
.turbo/
.npm/
.node_repl_history


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 05. LOGS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime logs — never commit.

*.log
logs/
*.log.*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.npm/_logs/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 06. OS-SPECIFIC JUNK FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.apdisk

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump
*.lnk

# --- Linux ---
.directory
.Trash-*
*.swp
*.swo
*~
nohup.out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 07. IDE / EDITOR FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE settings are per-developer — don't force on team.

# --- VS Code ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
.history/

# --- JetBrains (IntelliJ, WebStorm, PyCharm, etc.) ---
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/

# --- Vim / Neovim ---
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# --- Emacs ---
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# --- Sublime Text ---
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 08. ARCHIVES & BACKUPS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compressed files, backups, temp copies.

*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
*.gz
*.bz2
*.xz
*.bak
*.old
*.backup
*.orig
*.rej
*.save
*~


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 09. DATABASE FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local databases, dumps, backups — never commit.

*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-journal
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sql
dump/
dumps/
backup/
backups/
mongodb-dump/
.bson


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 10. TEMPORARY FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

tmp/
temp/
.tmp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.part
*.crdownload
*.download
*.partial

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 11. DEPLOYMENT / CI PLATFORMS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Platform-specific configs (auto-generated).

.vercel/
.netlify/
.heroku/
.firebase/
.render/
.railway/
.fly/
.docker/
.sentryclirc
.now/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 12. TESTING
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test artifacts — reproducible.

coverage/
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright/
.cypress/
cypress/screenshots/
cypress/videos/
*.lcov


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 13. PROJECT-SPECIFIC
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python (if used later) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Local data / uploads ---
data/
uploads/
public/uploads/
media/
storage/

# --- Source maps ---
*.map
*.css.map
*.js.map

# --- Local env files (extra safety) ---
local.settings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json.example


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 14. GIT-SPECIFIC
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Merge conflict artifacts.

*.orig
*.BACKUP
*.BASE
*.LOCAL
*.REMOTE


# =====================================================================
# REFERENCE — WHAT SHOULD BE COMMITTED
# =====================================================================
# ✅ DO COMMIT:
#   • .env.example                (template, no secrets)
#   • package.json                (dependency list)
#   • package-lock.json           (exact versions — reproducibility)
#   • Source code                 (*.js, *.html, *.css)
#   • Config files (non-secret)   (config.js — BACKEND_URL)
#   • Documentation               (README.md, docs/)
#   • Static assets               (images, fonts, icons)
#   • SEO files                   (robots.txt, sitemap.xml, manifest.json)
#   • PWA files                   (sw.js, manifest.json)
#   • .gitignore                  (this file)
#
# ❌ DO NOT COMMIT:
#   • .env                        (contains secrets)
#   • node_modules/               (dependencies — installed via npm)
#   • *.log                       (runtime logs)
#   • .DS_Store                   (OS junk)
#   • dist/, build/               (build artifacts)
#   • IDE folders                 (.vscode, .idea)
#   • Database dumps              (*.sqlite, *.db)
#   • SSL certs                   (*.pem, *.key)
#
# =====================================================================
# VERIFICATION COMMANDS
# =====================================================================
# Check if a file is ignored:
#   git check-ignore -v <file>
#
# List all ignored files:
#   git status --ignored
#
# Remove already-committed ignored files from tracking:
#   git rm -r --cached <path>
#   git commit -m "chore: remove ignored files"
#
# =====================================================================
# MAINTENANCE
# =====================================================================
# Review this file quarterly (next: 2026-04-15).
# Add new patterns when introducing new tools/frameworks.
# NEVER remove security-related patterns (.env, *.key, etc.).
#
# =====================================================================
# END OF .GITIGNORE
# =====================================================================